sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API
    participant Database
    participant Cache
    
    User->>API: Request data
    API->>Cache: Check cache
    Cache-->>API: Cache miss
    API->>Database: Query
    activate Database
    Database-->>API: Return data
    deactivate Database
    API->>Cache: Store result
    API-->>User: Response
    
    note right of API: Complex<br/>multi-line<br/>note
    
    alt Success case
        User->>API: Acknowledge
    else Error case
        API->>User: Retry prompt
    end
